# Google Apps Script web app URL (the /exec URL from Deploy > Web app).
# Vite inlines this into the member review page at build time.
# Do not commit a real URL. Do not put the invite token in this file.
# The token lives only in the invitation link (?t=) and in the script
# property SURVEY_TOKEN. See apps-script/README.md.
VITE_SURVEY_ENDPOINT=
